  "method": "Isolated HF 1.8.0 and 2.0.0 clients, each snapshot in an empty cache; hf-xet 1.6.0 installed. A loopback gateway relayed public HF Git/LFS/CDN requests, rewrote download action URLs through itself, counted response bodies and injected HTTP 503 upstream outages. No real HF tokens, existing model caches, NAS state or serving workload were used. The gateway buffers bodies; timings are not NAS performance evidence.",
